  lead:{"fr": "Vers l'an 500, un chef breton aurait vaincu les Saxons au mont Badon. Six siècles plus tard, les écrivains du Moyen Âge en font un roi magnifique, entouré de chevaliers et d'enchanteurs.", "en": "Around the year 500 a British leader supposedly defeated the Saxons at Mount Badon. Six centuries later medieval writers turned him into a magnificent king surrounded by knights and enchanters."},
