/* ---------- état ---------- */
/* Le stockage local peut contenir n'importe quoi (modifié à la main, extension, ancienne version) :
   chaque lecture passe par un contrôle de forme, sinon on revient à la valeur par défaut. */
const store = {
  get(k, fallback, ok){ try{ const v = localStorage.getItem(k); if(v===null) return fallback; const d = JSON.parse(v); return (!ok || ok(d)) ? d : fallback; }catch(e){ return fallback; } },
  set(k, v){ try{ localStorage.setItem(k, JSON.stringify(v)); }catch(e){} }
};
const urlLang = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get("lang");
const isLang = v => v==="fr" || v==="en";
let lang = isLang(urlLang) ? urlLang : store.get("lumora-lang", (navigator.language||"fr").startsWith("en") ? "en" : "fr", isLang);
let pageSize = 12, shown = 12;
let activeFilter = "all", currentArticle = null, lastFocus = null;
const isStrList = v => Array.isArray(v) && v.every(x=>typeof x==="string");
const saved = new Set(store.get("lumora-saved", [], isStrList).slice(0, 500));

const $ = s => document.querySelector(s), $$ = s => [...document.querySelectorAll(s)];
const t = k => ui[lang][k];
const uni = id => universes.find(u=>u.id===id);
const uniName = id => uni(id).name[lang];
const norm = s => s.normalize("NFD").replace(/[̀-ͯ]/g,"").toLowerCase();
const esc = s => String(s ?? "").replace(/[&<>"'`]/g, c => ({"&":"&amp;","<":"&lt;",">":"&gt;",'"':"&quot;","'":"&#39;","`":"&#96;"}[c]));
/* N'accepte que des adresses web http(s) : bloque javascript:, data:, vbscript:… venant de sources externes. */
const safeUrl = u => { if(typeof u!=="string") return ""; const v = u.trim(); if(!/^https?:\/\//i.test(v)) return ""; try{ const p = new URL(v); return (p.protocol==="https:"||p.protocol==="http:") ? p.href : ""; }catch(e){ return ""; } };

/* Photos des univers : servies par Wikimedia Commons (Special:FilePath), à télécharger et héberger soi-même pour la mise en ligne. */
const commonsImg = (file, w) => "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/" + encodeURIComponent(file.replace(/ /g,"_")) + "?width=" + w;
const commonsPage = file => "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:" + encodeURIComponent(file.replace(/ /g,"_"));

/* ---------- rendu ---------- */
function renderUniverses(){
  const total = String(universes.length).padStart(2,"0");
  $("#universeGrid").innerHTML = universes.map((u,i)=>`
    <button class="universe-card${u.featured?" featured":""}${u.photo?" has-photo":""}" data-category="${u.id}" style="--glow:${u.glow};--shade:${u.shade}">
      ${u.photo?`<span class="universe-photo" aria-hidden="true"><img src="${u.photo.src || commonsImg(u.photo.file, u.featured?1280:640)}" alt="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"></span>`:""}
      <span class="card-number">${String(i+1).padStart(2,"0")} / ${total}<span class="card-number-name"> · ${esc(u.name[lang].toUpperCase())}</span></span>
      <span class="universe-icon" aria-hidden="true">${u.icon}</span>
      <span class="universe-title">${esc(u.name[lang])}</span>
      <span class="universe-sub">${esc(u.sub[lang])}</span>
      <span class="universe-domains">${esc(u.domains[lang].join(" · "))}</span>
      <span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </button>`).join("");
  $$(".universe-card").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>{ location.hash = "#/u/"+b.dataset.category; }));
}

function renderFilters(){
  $("#filterRow").innerHTML = [`<button class="filter-chip" data-filter="all">${esc(t("filterAll"))}</button>`]
    .concat(universes.map(u=>`<button class="filter-chip" data-filter="${u.id}">${esc(u.name[lang])}</button>`)).join("");
  $$(".filter-chip").forEach(b=>{ b.classList.toggle("selected", b.dataset.filter===activeFilter); b.addEventListener("click",()=>setFilter(b.dataset.filter)); });
}

function matches(x, q){
  if(!q) return true;
  const hay = norm([x.title[lang], x.desc[lang], x.lead[lang], x.body[lang], x.facts[lang].join(" "), uniName(x.cat),
                    x.title[lang==="fr"?"en":"fr"]].join(" "));
  return norm(q).split(/\s+/).every(w => hay.includes(w));
}

function renderCards(){
  const q = $("#searchInput").value.trim();
  const list = items.filter(x => (activeFilter==="all" || x.cat===activeFilter) && matches(x, q));
  $("#discoveryGrid").innerHTML = list.slice(0, shown).map(cardHTML).join("");
  $("#emptyState").hidden = list.length > 0;
  const rest = list.length - shown;
  $("#moreRow").hidden = rest <= 0;
  if(rest > 0) $("#showMore").textContent = t("showMore")(rest);
  bindCards($("#discoveryGrid"));
}

function renderNews(){ if(typeof renderNewsFeed==="function") renderNewsFeed(); }

function renderCredits(){
  const rows = universes.filter(u=>u.photo).map(u=>`<li><strong>${esc(u.name[lang])}</strong> — ${esc(typeof u.photo.credit==="string"?u.photo.credit:u.photo.credit[lang])} · ${esc(u.photo.license[lang])} ${u.photo.file?` · <a href="${commonsPage(u.photo.file)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Wikimedia Commons ↗</a>`:""}</li>`);
  rows.push(`<li><strong>${esc(t("earthCreditTitle"))}</strong> — ${esc(t("earthCredit"))}</li>`);
  rows.push(`<li><strong>${esc(t("discoveryCreditsTitle"))}</strong> — ${esc(t("discoveryCredits"))}</li>`);
  $("#creditsList").innerHTML = rows.join("");
}

function renderTrending(){
  $("#trending").innerHTML = `<span>${esc(t("trending"))}</span>` +
    t("trends").map(q=>`<button class="trend" data-query="${esc(q)}">${esc(q)}</button>`).join("");
  $$(".trend").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>{ $("#searchInput").value=b.dataset.query; $("#searchForm").requestSubmit(); }));
}

function applyStatic(){
  document.documentElement.lang = lang;
  document.title = t("pageTitle");
  document.querySelector('meta[name="description"]').setAttribute("content", t("metaDesc"));
  $$("[data-i18n]").forEach(el=>{ const v=t(el.dataset.i18n); if(typeof v==="string") el.innerHTML=v; });
  $$("[data-i18n-placeholder]").forEach(el=>el.placeholder=t(el.dataset.i18nPlaceholder));
  $$("[data-i18n-aria]").forEach(el=>el.setAttribute("aria-label", t(el.dataset.i18nAria)));
  $("#languageToggle").textContent = lang==="fr" ? "EN" : "FR";
  $("#heroCount").textContent = t("heroCount")(universes.length, items.length);
}

function renderAll(){
  applyStatic(); renderTrending(); renderUniverses(); renderCredits(); renderFilters(); renderCards(); renderNews();
  renderExtras();
}

/* ---------- interactions ---------- */
function setFilter(f){
  activeFilter = f; shown = pageSize;
  $$(".filter-chip").forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle("selected", b.dataset.filter===f));
  renderCards();
}

function openArticle(id){ location.hash = "#/d/"+id; }

function showToast(msg){ const el=$("#toast"); el.textContent=msg; el.classList.add("show"); setTimeout(()=>el.classList.remove("show"),2100); }

function changeLanguage(){
  lang = lang==="fr" ? "en" : "fr";
  store.set("lumora-lang", lang);
  try{ const url = new URL(location.href); url.searchParams.set("lang", lang); history.replaceState(null, "", url); }catch(e){}
  renderAll();
}

function resetFilterAndSearch(){ activeFilter="all"; shown = pageSize; $$(".filter-chip").forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle("selected", b.dataset.filter==="all")); renderCards(); }

$("#languageToggle").addEventListener("click", changeLanguage);
$("#showMore").addEventListener("click", ()=>{ shown += pageSize; renderCards(); });
$("#searchForm").addEventListener("submit", e=>{ e.preventDefault(); resetFilterAndSearch(); $("#discoveries").scrollIntoView({behavior:"smooth"}); });
$("#searchInput").addEventListener("input", resetFilterAndSearch);
$("#searchFocus").addEventListener("click", ()=>{ if(location.hash.startsWith("#/") && location.hash!=="#/") location.hash="#/"; setTimeout(()=>{ window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:"smooth"}); $("#searchInput").focus({preventScroll:true}); },30); });
$("#showAll").addEventListener("click", ()=>{ setFilter("all"); $("#discoveries").scrollIntoView({behavior:"smooth"}); });
$$("[data-open]").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click", ()=>openArticle(b.dataset.open)));
$("#menuToggle").addEventListener("click", ()=>$(".desktop-nav").classList.toggle("open"));
$$(".desktop-nav a").forEach(a=>a.addEventListener("click", ()=>$(".desktop-nav").classList.remove("open")));

/* premier rendu : à la fin de pages.js */
